abstract: >-
  A free, open-source website and editor dashboard for student newspapers, written in
  plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no build step, no framework and no runtime
  dependencies. It runs on GitHub Pages or inside a school's existing website platform,
  which supplies sign-in and decides who is an editor. Every published story is also
  emitted as a static page so links preview in group chats; a WordPress or SNO archive
  imports in one command; 1,151 automated checks in 26 jsdom suites drive the real pages.
